        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146640,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir oyunda puan eklemek veya kaybetmek gibi işlemlerde değişkenlerin değerleri nasıl takip ettiğini açıklayan yeni bir kavram öğrenelim.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   button {&#xA;    background-color: darkBlue;&#xA;    border: none;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    text-decoration: none;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    font-size: 14px;&#xA;    padding: 6px 12px;&#xA;    margin: 0 12px 0 0;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Score: &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;amount&quot;&gt;15&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;add()&quot;&gt;Gain +1&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;remove()&quot;&gt;Lose -1&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let score = 15;&#xA;   let amountCounter = document.getElementById(&quot;amount&quot;);&#xA;   &#xA;   function add() {&#xA;    score += 1;&#xA;    amountCounter.innerHTML = score;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   function remove() {&#xA;    score -= 1;&#xA;    amountCounter.innerHTML = score;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146641,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir değişken oluşturduğumuzda ona bir değer <strong>atarız</strong>; örneğin <code>3</code> değerini <code>score</code>'a atarız.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>=</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146642,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Kendine atama</strong>, bir değişkeni kendi değerine ayarlamaktır. Örneğin, <code>playerHealth</code> değişkenini <code>playerHealth = playerHealth</code> ile <code>3</code> değerine ayarlayabiliriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = playerHealth;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>playerHealth</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve sonra <code>playerHealth</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146643,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Değişkenlere kendilerini atayabildiğimize göre sayı değişkenlerini artırabilir veya azaltabiliriz. <code>playerHealth</code> değerini 1 artırmayı dene.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = playerHealth + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3 + 1\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"53\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>playerHealth + 1</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146644,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kendine atama yapan değişkenler, zaman içinde değişen verileri takip etmemizi sağlar. Örneğin bir oyuncu <code>2</code> can puanı iyileştirebilir ve ardından <code>1</code> hasar alabilir.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = playerHealth + \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerHealth = playerHealth - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>2</code>, ardından <code>1</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 146645,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dizelere ayarlanan değişkenler de aynı şekilde çalışır. <code>hudText</code>'i <code>hudText + \" Level 2\"</code> olarak ayarlamayı dene.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"79\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hudText = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Now playing:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hudText = hudText + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Level 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hudText = hudText + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Level 2&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hudText);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>hudText</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 146646,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>enemySpeed</code> değişkenine atanan değer nedir?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemySpeed = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>enemySpeed</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>0</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
